{"id": "22-445-2-2", "zh": "增音连声（āgamasandhi）", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-446-2-4", "zh": "现在说明增音连声。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-447-2-4", "zh": "依大规则（mahāvutti），有元音增音：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-448-2-3", "zh": "a：", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-449-2-77", "zh": "paṇṇasālaṃ amāpetvā［jā.2.22.1913］、paṇṇasālaṃ amāpiya［jā.1.1.148］——意思就是 māpetvā（建造之后）；na cāpi apunappunaṃ, hatthibondiṃ pavekkhāmi［jā.1.1.148］——意思就是 punappunaṃ（一再）；natthi loke anāmataṃ［jā.1.2.31］——意思是“世上没有从前不曾死过人的地方”；anavajjaṃ、anamataggo、jaccandho、jaccabadhiro、jaccamūgo、jaccapaṇḍako。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-450-2-3", "zh": "ā：", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-451-2-26", "zh": "aḍḍhe ājāyare kule［saṃ.ni.1.49］、manussesu paccājāto、āpūrati tassa yaso［pari.386］。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-452-2-3", "zh": "i：", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-453-2-14", "zh": "dhammikathaṃ katvā［pārā.39］；sarantā sapanti gacchantīti sarisapā（爬着、匍匐着行走，所以叫 sarisapa，即爬行类）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-454-2-3", "zh": "ī：", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-455-2-13", "zh": "kabaḷīkāro、manasīkāro、manasīkaroti、tappākaṭīkaroti、dūrībhūto、abyayībhāvo。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-456-2-3", "zh": "u：", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-457-2-12", "zh": "ñātiparijinassa bhāvo ñātipārijuññaṃ（亲属衰损的状态，叫 ñātipārijuñña），bhogapārijuññaṃ 也是这样；parijinassa 就是“衰减的”“耗尽的”的意思。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-458-2-3", "zh": "o：", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-459-2-15", "zh": "parosataṃ、saradosataṃ、disodisaṃ［dha.pa.42］等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-460-2-23", "zh": "在“atippago kho tāva piṇḍāya carituṃ”［dī.ni.3.1］这里，表示“清早”的 pago 本身就是一个词（不是增音）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-461-2-4", "zh": "以上是元音增音类。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-462-2-5", "zh": "50. va、na、ta、ra、ga，以及（ma、ya、da）是增音。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-463-2-20", "zh": "后面是元音时，va、na、ta、ra、ga，以及 ma、ya、da 作为增音出现。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-464-2-17", "zh": "go、to、do、no、mo、yo、ro、vo。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-465-2-5", "zh": "其中 go：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-466-2-25", "zh": "ariyehi puthagevāyaṃ janoti puthujjano［mahāniddesa］（这种人与圣者各自分开，所以叫 puthujjana，即凡夫）；但这里的 pageva 只是 pago 这个词本身，如 pageva vutyassa、pageva manussitthiyā［pārā.55］。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-467-2-3", "zh": "to：", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-468-2-44", "zh": "ajjatagge［dī.ni.1.250］、tasmātiha［ma.ni.1.29］、katamo nāma so rukkho, yassa tevaṃ gataṃ phalaṃ［jā.2.18.10］——tevaṃ 就是 evaṃ（这样）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-469-2-3", "zh": "do：", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-470-2-50", "zh": "udaggo、udabbahi、udapādi、udayo、udāhaṭo、udito、udīrito、dubhato vuṭṭhānaṃ［paṭisambhidāmagga；visuddhimagga］、dubhayāni viceyya paṇḍarāni［su.ni.531］、todeyya, kappā dubhayo［su.ni.1131］——意思是两位仙人。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-470-51-120", "zh": "kiñcideva、kocideva、kismiñcideva、yāvadeva、tāvadeva——va 脱落时就构成 yāvade、tāvade；punadeva、sakideva、sammadeva——加 da 增音时元音变短；sammadakkhāto［saṃ.ni.5.195］、sammadaññā vimutto［ma.ni.2.234］、bahudeva rattiṃ［a.ni.3.101］、ahudeva bhayaṃ［dī.ni.1.159］等。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-471-2-3", "zh": "no：", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-472-2-48", "zh": "ito nāyati、ciraṃ nāyati；kamme sādhu kammaniyaṃ kammaññaṃ（适合于作业的，叫 kammaniya、kammañña）；attano idaṃ attaniyaṃ（属于自己的，叫 attaniya）；addhānaṃ khamatīti addhaniyaṃ（能够经久的，叫 addhaniya）；lobhassa hitaṃ lobhaniyaṃ lobhaneyyaṃ（有利于贪的，叫 lobhaniya、lobhaneyya）；dosaniyaṃ dosaneyyaṃ、mohaniyaṃ mohaneyyaṃ、oghaniyaṃ、yoganiyaṃ、ganthaniyaṃ、niddhunanaṃ、niddhunanako、sañjānanaṃ、sañjānanako、saññāpanako 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-473-2-4", "zh": "mo：", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-474-2-55", "zh": "lahumessati［dha.pa.369］、garumessati、maggamatthi［vibha.aṭṭha.189］、aggamakkhāyati［a.ni.4.34］、uragāmiva［jā.1.7.30］、arahatāmiva［dī.ni.2.348］等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-474-56-129", "zh": "同样还有 kena te idha mijjhati［pe.va.181］、rūpāni manupassati［dha.sa.aṭṭha.596］、ākāse mabhipūjaye、aññamaññassa［ma.ni.3.40］、ekamekassa［pārā.aṭṭha.1.23］、samaṇamacalo［a.ni.4.87］、adukkhamasukhā vedanā［saṃ.ni.4.250］等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-475-2-3", "zh": "yo：", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-476-2-98", "zh": "nayimassa vijjā mayamatthi［jā.1.3.25］、yathayidaṃ［a.ni.1.21-22］、tathayidaṃ、chayime dhammā［a.ni.6.11］、navayime dhammā［a.ni.9.9］、dasayime dhammā［a.ni.10.16］、mamayidaṃ、soyeva、teyeva、taṃyeva taññeva、tehiyeva、tesaṃyeva tesaññeva、tasmiyeva、buddhoyeva、buddhesuyeva、bodhiyāyeva kāraṇā［cariyā.1.65］、hotiyeva、atthiyeva 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-476-99-108", "zh": "tiyantaṃ、aggiyāgāre、catutthīyatthe 等以 i 类元音结尾的词形，也可以用 ya 增音来构成。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-477-2-3", "zh": "ro：", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-478-2-201", "zh": "nirantaraṃ、niratthakaṃ、nirāhāro、nirābādho、nirālayo、nirindhano aggi、nirīhakaṃ、nirudakaṃ、nirutti、niruttaro、nirūmikā nadī、nirojaṃ、duratikkamo、durabhisambhavo、durāsadā buddhā［apa.thera 1.40.270］、durākhyāto dhammo［dī.ni.3.166］、durāgataṃ、duruttaṃ vacanaṃ［a.ni.5.140］、pāturahosi［mahāva.8］、pāturahu［jā.1.14.202］、pāturahesuṃ［a.ni.3.71］、pātarāso、punareti、dhīratthu［jā.1.1.13］、caturaṅgikaṃ jhānaṃ［dha.sa.168］、caturārakkhā、caturāsītisahassāni、caturiddhilābho、caturoghā、vuddhiresā［dī.ni.1.251］、pathavīdhāturevesā［ma.ni.3.348-349］、āpodhāturevesā［ma.ni.3.350］、sabbhireva samāsetha、nakkhattarājāriva tārakānaṃ、vijjuriva abbhakūṭe、āraggeriva、usabhoriva［su.ni.29］、yathariva、tathariva［dī.ni.1.263］——加 ra 增音时元音变短。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-478-202-258", "zh": "这里，正如在“atiriva kallarūpā［su.ni.688］、ativiya lābhaggayasaggapatto、paraṃviya mattāya”等例中，iva、viya 两个词用作 eva（确实）的意思一样，在“yathariva、tathariva、varamhākaṃ bhusāmiva［jā.1.3.108］、netaṃ ajjatanāmiva”等例中，iva 这个词也用作 eva 的意思。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-479-2-3", "zh": "vo：", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-480-2-39", "zh": "duvaṅgulaṃ、duvaṅgikaṃ、tivaṅgulaṃ、tivaṅgikaṃ、pāguññavujutā、vusitaṃ、vuttaṃ、vuccate、āsanā vuṭṭhāti［pāci.547］、vuṭṭhānaṃ、vuṭṭhahitvā、bhikkhuvāsane、puthuvāsane、sayambhuvāsane 等以 u 类元音结尾的词形，也可以用 va 增音来构成。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-481-2-7", "zh": "51. cha 之后加 ḷa。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-482-2-7", "zh": "后面是元音时，cha 之后有 ḷa 增音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-483-2-46", "zh": "chaḷaṅgaṃ、chaḷāyatanaṃ、chaḷāsītisahassāni［pe.va.374］、atthassa dvārā pamukhā chaḷete［jā.1.1.84］、chaḷevānusayā honti［abhidhammatthasaṅgaha］、chaḷabhiññā mahiddhikā［bu.vaṃ.3.5］。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-484-2-3", "zh": "下面说明大规则（mahāvutti）的规定。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-485-2-7", "zh": "后面是元音时，mana 等词之后有 sa 增音：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-486-2-28", "zh": "manasikāro、mānasiko、cetasiko、abyaggamanaso naro［a.ni.1.30］、putto jāto acetaso、ure bhavo oraso（生于胸中的，叫 orasa，即亲生子）等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-487-2-6", "zh": "后面是元音时，常常有 ha 增音：", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-488-2-69", "zh": "māhevaṃ ānanda［dī.ni.2.95］、nohetaṃ bhante［dī.ni.1.185-186］、nohidaṃ bho gotama［dī.ni.1.263］、nahevaṃ vattabbe［kathā.1］、hevaṃ vattabbe、hevaṃ vadati、ujū ca suhujū ca［khu.pā.9.1］、suhuṭṭhitaṃ sukhaṇo 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-489-2-4", "zh": "以上是辅音增音类。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-490-2-22", "zh": "52. 鼻音（niggahīta）［ka.35；rū.21（piṭṭhe）；nī.56］。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-491-2-7", "zh": "鼻音有时可以作为增音出现。", "confidence": 75}
